{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AAA level needs to have textual component matching 7:1 contrast ratio"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is recommended for mobiles devices projects (because of screen sizes and luminosity issues)."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAAA","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"requirementsAAA","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements"}],"externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV15requirementsAAASb7textual_Sb10nonTextualtvp","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/requirementsaaa"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"ic_layers.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_layers.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}]},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoun